  "commit_message": "feat(trg): TRG pipeline, container streaming, and host adapters for SINC, STAFF, and LIT\n\n- Implement pure binary TRG compiler pipeline (7 keywords, 7 passes)\n- Add genuine silicon SWAR container validation (Magic 'T', Script 1, Flags 0)\n- Upgrade STAFF and LIT to pure TRG container streaming and manifest parsing\n- Provide bin/sinc and bin/staff as Linux Host Compatibility Adapters\n- Track verified bootstrap binaries (bin/*.elf, bin/*.safe) with executable permissions (100755)\n- Pass all release gates (15/15 STAFF, 21/21 LIT, 6/6 TRG, 134/134 native, 24/24 GCC benchmarks)",
